      "name": "Mystical Defenses",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>Countdown (12). To climb the tower, the PCs must complete the countdown. On a failure or a roll with Fear, they trigger one of the archmage's many arcane traps and hazards, taking <strong>3d10</strong> magic damage. On a failure with Fear, the damage dealt gains a bonus equal to the PC's level.</p><section id=\"secret-nspaK2xThGNULFBI\" class=\"secret\"><p>What do the designs of the archmage's defenses tell you about their specific area of expertise? What signature style or flourish do the traps and hazards all share?</p></section>",
