    {
      "name": "Archmage's Aerie",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>The top floor of the tower is a many-chambered laboratory, library, and workshop containing everything needed to study magic in its highest forms. A PC with a Spellcast Trait can make a Knowledge Roll to partake in the archmage's research. On a success, they gain a +1 bonus to their Spellcast Rolls until their next long rest. On a failure, their investigation goes wrong, and they take <strong>3d8+4</strong> magic damage.</p><section id=\"secret-ahV0x7MO1b57M1Gg\" class=\"secret\"><p>What part of the aerie calls to you? What do the archmage's notes reveal to you?</p></section>",
